{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0622_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0622_1001_p", "source_sha256": "519cb3dd44f5ef99004e0f2fb8d2a6afe0a1ddf882b87e758c7dd15ba7e48bc0", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ、瑞希。\n今日はハロウィンじゃないけど……。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，瑞希。今天又不是万圣节……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
