{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0622_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0622_1005", "source_sha256": "5041f23aecc8158431eb4824f78775f846067ccd029f5adc531c2354914b33b4", "ja": "どうぞ", "zh": "请用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0622_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0622_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6a35b187b7d8ea0b7d4db01e4e762f9fd5c0268cfa24aafef93c15dd2f234482", "ja": "多めに買ったものの、余っちゃってね。\nそんなに気に入ってくれたならプレゼントするよ。", "zh": "买得多了点，正好多出来了。\n既然你这么喜欢，那就送给你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0622_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0622_2001_044miz", "source_sha256": "32d03bc41405a1123ca030193d29069c5c40c2db787af0a86134f000e73691bc", "ja": "こ、これは……私が求めていたお菓子。\n{$P$}、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "这、这是……我一直想要的点心。  \n{$P$}，谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0622_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0622_2002_044miz", "source_sha256": "00012cad88e2f02a465a045b64118f5d41a1cd33d500372289b1cfd6a6780b7b", "ja": "これにてハロウィンは終了です。\n来年も楽しみですね。お菓子も、イタズラも。", "zh": "万圣节到此结束。\n期待明年的万圣节呢。无论是糖果，还是恶作剧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
